# Royal Puppeteer (ToAU 12, mission.toau.royal_puppeteer). A level 75 Warrior of Bastok with it current, status 0, in Aht
# Urhgan Whitegate: Naja 3071. Nashmau: Pyopyoroon, a trade of the vial at status 0: nothing; his trigger 277, finished:
# status 1; again: 278 (once per zone); again in the zone: nothing from this section; a trade of a different item (a Bronze
# Piece): nothing; the Vial of Jody's Acid: 279, finished: completed (the Vial of Spectral Scent, Lost Kingdom
# current), the vial taken.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger Nashmau/Pyopyoroon/onTrigger Nashmau/Pyopyoroon/onTrade Nashmau/onEventFinish/277 Nashmau/onEventFinish/279
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
